WEBVTT

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.840
Moriyama-kun, I'm currently writing this letter in the car.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:45.260
I've been at my grandma's house in the country since last week.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:49.900
The air is fresh and the food is really delicious.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.000
This is good!

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.240
At night, fireflies light up at the riverside near here.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:58.260
There's a lot of them and it's really pretty!

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.100
I'll bring you a souvenir when I come back.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.850
I'll bring some for Pote-chan and the others too.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:11.340
Seems like she's going to buy us some souvenirs.

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.050
Here's papa's souvenir for you!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.890
Throw that thing away.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:26.140
The End of Summer

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.670
I see, I see. You've found someone you like too, Mikan.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:34.510
Yeah.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:39.200
So what kind of boy is that Moriyama-kun?

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.980
How should I put it...

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.900
He's really kind...

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:49.960
He keeps some weird thing on his head.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.500
Huh? Lice?

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:53.670
Yasumi!

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:06.780
Oh, this way.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:10.500
Stop it.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:11.480
Why?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.900
You'll be a bother to the other passengers.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.120
There aren't any other passengers though!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.320
Stop it anyways.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.780
No way!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.210
Alright, we're here.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.910
Let's go visit her.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:30.360
We're really going to have to clean this up.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:31.670
Weeding Team!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.490
Alright! Watering Team!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.410
Alright! Coordinator Team!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.650
Here! Alright!

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:41.670
Coordinator?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.290
This should do it.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:51.280
Clean up properly and then pray, okay?

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.210
I know already, geez...

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.300
Ghost!

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.960
Alright, let's pull out the weeds.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.710
Su-Suna...Suna-o.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.930
Su-Su-nao. Suna-o.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:39.310
You did it again, huh? We didn't bring any change of pants for you.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:02.170
So we'll be using the little time left we have for the summer to help each other finish our homework!

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:07.130
There's nothing we can't do if we combine our powers!

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.640
No good.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.500
I can't solve this.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:18.570
Hey! You're giving up too quickly!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.770
We'll dry this over here, okay?

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.260
Hey, aren't you kind of hungry?

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.290
Let's work a little more!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.000
Hey, hey, say pizza 10 times.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.810
What is it so suddenly?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.580
Concentrate, concentrate!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.490
C'mon, say it!

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.940
Pizza, pizza, pizza,...

00:05:58.380 --> 00:05:59.190
Then what's this?

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.200
An arm?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.520
Tell your mom everything that happened since New Years to August.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:11.290
Since it's you, there probably isn't much change though.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:24.970
Shyness...

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.030
But only for a moment.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:35.000
Oh, what is it? You're done telling your bittersweet stories?

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.130
And at the start, I didn't get along with him.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.630
I see, and why's that?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.650
He doesn't really talk much.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:52.000
I see. Then he's just like your grandpa!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:57.690
But, was it last on May last year...? During the sports festival...

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.830
The participants for the class have been decided now.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.580
It's starting pretty early this year.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:07.100
Yeah, it's a break from the exams.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:10.950
Besides that, you're pretty amazing Natsu-san. The 300m race?

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:14.030
I'm not good at short distance races and the ball games.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:19.290
With cross country, we'll be running through the neighbourhood so I can take it easy and view the scenery.

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.270
You're at the halfway point! Good luck!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.100
I'm getting pretty tired now.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.520
I'll play some sign shiritori to plow through the race.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.240
Tofu, fu, fu, fu...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.690
Futaba Denki, ki, ki, ki...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.690
TL: Futaba Electronics

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.590
Kishime--Ah, that won't work.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.070
Ki, ki, ki...ah!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.830
Kimura Fud---

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.830
TL: Kimura Fudousan - Kimura Real Estates

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.670
That doesn't count! That one doesn't count!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.840
Ki, ki, ki, ki...

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.230
Natsu-san?

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:04.010
Ki, ki, ki...

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.590
I'm really sorry!

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:13.560
I couldn't find the way back, so...

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.880
Well, I'm glad you're fine.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.800
You came first place in our class so don't worry about it.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.250
Go change.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.680
Hot dog.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.290
Welcome back.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.340
I see, you have to change. Sorry, I'll get out now.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.040
Ah, no, that's not it.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:57.650
I'm back.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.520
I see, I see!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:20.640
I'm sure Moriyama-kun doesn't remember but I was happy.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.420
I was really happy.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.420
Did you tell her everything you wanted?

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:38.110
Hey! Mochi-mochi! We're going home!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.490
Let's go eat.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.300
I'm hungry.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:45.960
Me too.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.520
I have instant ramen.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:56.610
Hey, do you know how to make this ramen in 1 minute?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.150
Can you even do that?

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.280
Probably.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:03.950
First, you split one pack of ramen into three.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.080
You then put them into bowls. And then when you put in hot water...

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.000
They'll be done in 1 minute!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.990
No, no, that's wrong.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.040
Guess I'll buy a souvenir too.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.180
It's getting hot here!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:28.990
Shut up.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.170
A rock. A plank of wood.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.430
No, we don't need those.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:38.110
Shut up.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.670
Around that time, Guchuko was...

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:03.940
Guchuko!

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.550
Hey, stop!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.920
Stop, stop! Stop!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:24.200
It's really hot this time! So pull it together and eat some ice cream to cool down!

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:30.870
It's really hot this time! So pull it together and eat some ice cream to cool down!

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.210
Suna-o.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.600
Ice cream, huh?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.860
Papa wants to eat ice cream!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.950
Let's cool down Pote's body!

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.130
Let's go buy some ice cream.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.330
I didn't get anything done.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:00.770
We're just not fit to do homework.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.470
There's no one fit to do it.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.350
Be patient until we get home. That's bad manners.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.870
I'm sorry.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.330
I just finished eating it all.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.180
Was it good?

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.950
Yes, unusually good.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:26.200
You bought milk ice cream, right?

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:26.920
Yes.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:31.620
The one I bought has around 10% milk fat.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.990
We're actually aiming for ice cream that's around 8% for our new product.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:44.370
Yours is around 10% and mine is around 3% milk ice cream---huh?

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.540
It's okay now!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.690
So hot!

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:56.520
Let's buy a 4 seat car already!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.520
Where are we going to get the money for that?

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.370
Save up money yourself if you want to buy one.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.060
C'mon, let's carry in the luggage.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.730
I'll help you.

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:09.740
I don't need your help. I'll do it myself.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.930
Moriyama-kun!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:17.900
Moriyama?

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:19.570
Ya-sumi!

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.680
Calm down!

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:23.070
Ya-sumi!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.930
Let go! I said let go!

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:32.140
Welcome back.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:35.720
I'm back.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:48.290
Hey, kids really grow even without parents, huh?

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.610
Hey, where were you?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.130
The kids went to the convenience store.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:28.500
The mysterious creature that suddenly appeared out of the Moriyama residence's refrigerator.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.710
That's Potemayo.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.380
She's been like that for a while now.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.880
I wonder if she's remembering something?

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.560
●Festival Information●

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:56.570
Night of the Festival

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:03.360
Hey, Moriyama-kun, are you going to the festival today?

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.370
Yeah.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:09.680
I see, then if you'd like let's go together.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:09.660
Like I'd go with you!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.480
Stop, stop, stop!

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.220
Sure, okay.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.990
Who'd want to go with you?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.360
Yasumi!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.530
Festival? Sounds good!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:26.640
Let's all go then.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.060
I agree!

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.230
Very well!

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:33.080
Then when school's done, we'll meet up at the front of the shrine after we've all changed.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:49.060
Come to think of it, this is Potemayo's first festival.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:52.360
She's gotten used to living here already.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.070
Listen, don't spend it carelessly okay?

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.810
Look after your own money well.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.020
Ah, a cat.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.850
Good, keep it up.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.020
Aren't you lucky, Pote?

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.020
It's your first time getting spending money, huh?

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.780
Aren't you glad, Pote-chan?

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.320
I'm happy for you.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.410
Mutan! Mutan!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.210
It's your turn now, Mutan!

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.740
Turn?

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.290
That's right! When it comes to festivals, there are portable shrines!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.980
When it comes to portable shrines, there are parades!

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:39.410
When it comes to parades, there are cheerleaders!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:56.130
Mutan...you're shining. You're shining brightly, Mutan!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.710
Mutan, I think I really do...

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.090
It's gross... It's gross but...!

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.530
Are you two alright?

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.310
That was something I wouldn't even see in my dreams.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.740
Let's buy something to change our moods.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.200
Good idea, let's do that.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.380
There's a lot of different stands though, huh?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.130
What should I buy?

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.610
It's hard to decide.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.400
What are you going to buy, Pote?

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.560
You should check things properly next time, okay?

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:02.980
Look, mama! I got a stuffed doll!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.210
Go help her already.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:13.690
I told you to check things properly.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.770
Just hug her already.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.480
You're all quite the challengers.

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:25.210
No, no. You're the real challenger, Ei-chan..

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.070
I don't really have any confidence.

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:35.150
These are good!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.960
What? You haven't bought anything yet?

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.800
There are so many things it's hard to choose.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.580
Well with only 500 yen, you can only buy about 2 things.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:07.420
Wetting the needle or dipping it in water is cheating, alright?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:08.770
Okay.

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:14.380
It's surprising but I'm pretty good at things like this.

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:15.420
Liar.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:20.170
You failed because you couldn't concentrate!

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.020
Let me try next!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.040
Okay, good luck.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.330
A water yoyo?

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.810
I'm surprised she didn't get food.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:52.660
Hey, try playing with it.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:10.310
Let's go home.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:14.040
We know you can concentrate well already.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:19.930
Hey, ladies! It's about time to close the stand so could you hurry?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.180
Okay.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.110
Pote-chan's sleeping already.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.010
She was excited the entire time.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.520
It must have been really fun for her.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.180
Yeah, a lot of fun.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.900
What was that?

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:42.340
A wind attack?

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:45.460
Guchuko had a lot of fun too.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:19.360
The mysterious creature that suddenly appeared out of our refrigerator.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.300
That's Potemayo.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.480
You'll catch a cold if you sleep here.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.150
It's pretty loud.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:34.140
Well, our refrigerator's pretty old.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:40.030
The sound of the motor and water...

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:45.900
I wonder if this how it is inside a stomach?

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:50.880
The next morning.
